import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 328 | Perfect-Work Supreme-Bone Dig-Out Incident: The Predatory System's Original-Sin Exhibit","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 328 | Perfect-Work Supreme-Bone Dig-Out Incident: The Predatory System's Original-Sin Exhibit","no":328,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Perfect World","Shi Hao","Supreme Bone","Bloodline Monopoly","Original Sin"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","47-Anti-Monopoly Law","08-Everyone-Has-a-Road Guarantee System"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0328_模块2-完美世界-至尊骨被挖事件.md","filePath":"en/0328_模块2-完美世界-至尊骨被挖事件.md"}`),o={name:"en/0328_模块2-完美世界-至尊骨被挖事件.md"};function s(r,e,l,d,u,h){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-328-perfect-work-supreme-bone-dig-out-incident-the-predatory-system-s-original-sin-exhibit" tabindex="-1">Entry 328 | Perfect-Work Supreme-Bone Dig-Out Incident: The Predatory System&#39;s Original-Sin Exhibit <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-328-perfect-work-supreme-bone-dig-out-incident-the-predatory-system-s-original-sin-exhibit" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 328 | Perfect-Work Supreme-Bone Dig-Out Incident: The Predatory System&#39;s Original-Sin Exhibit&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Perfect-Work Full Decomposition (Entry 5) | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 47, 08</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-one-bone-dug-out-illuminates-the-entire-system-s-lesion" tabindex="-1">Introduction: One bone dug out illuminates the entire system&#39;s lesion <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-one-bone-dug-out-illuminates-the-entire-system-s-lesion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: One bone dug out illuminates the entire system&#39;s lesion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Shi Hao was born with the Supreme Bone; in childhood it was dug out by elders of his clan and transplanted to another clansman. This is Perfect World&#39;s most painful opening, and its most valuable civilization specimen — it uses the most extreme means to place the &quot;predatory system&#39;s original sin&quot; in front of readers. This entry takes the six top-level axioms as base — anti-predation axiom, republican axiom of Myriad Races, collective ascension axiom, causal self-discipline axiom, law-first axiom (core), universal equal infinite law — to dissect this event&#39;s institutional meaning. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Protagonist uniqueness dependency verdict: <strong>Shi Hao = extreme-leaning-medium / single-log tendency</strong>.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Supreme-Bone incident&#39;s waste:</p><ul><li>A Supreme who could have grown naturally is artificially interrupted, talent taken</li><li>The transplant recipient gets a &quot;predated aptitude,&quot; destined to walk unsteadily on this road</li><li>The whole event wastes two aptitudes, only manufactures one hatred</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Supreme-Bone incident is no isolated case, but the institution&#39;s inevitability:</p><ol><li><strong>Aptitude private</strong>: the Supreme Bone is defaulted as private property that a clan can &quot;distribute,&quot; showing the highest aptitude is monopolized by strong-one families from the start</li><li><strong>Bloodline = resource</strong>: talent is treated as transplantable, contestable stock, not a road everyone can walk</li><li><strong>Weak unprotected</strong>: child Shi Hao unprotected, proving the system has no &quot;everyone-has-a-road&quot; baseline</li></ol><p>Such a system: golden ages are accident, predation is the norm.</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Tellingly, Shi Hao later taking back the Supreme Bone and re-cultivating the Supreme path is essentially &quot;responding to predation with predation&quot;:</p><ul><li>He used stronger force to take back what was taken</li><li>But he did not overturn the &quot;aptitude can be contested&quot; law, only changed from victim to stronger contender</li><li>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s stance: sympathize with Shi Hao&#39;s plight, but do not endorse him using the predation path to solve predation — this only perpetuates the system unchanged</li></ul><p>The true solution is not &quot;grab the bone back,&quot; but &quot;make bone-style aptitude no longer diggable.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Supreme-Bone Incident (Predatory-System Original Sin)</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Aptitude can be clan-distributed and privately taken</td><td>Anti-monopoly constitutionalized, aptitude development universalized</td></tr><tr><td>Strong-one families monopolize talent</td><td>Myriad Ranks 99% full coverage, everyone has a road</td></tr><tr><td>Weak child unprotected</td><td>Everyone-Has-a-Road Guarantee System bottoms out</td></tr><tr><td>Respond to predation with predation</td><td>Causal self-discipline + Symbiotic Court adjudication</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li>Replicate the &quot;aptitude transplantable&quot; institutional parameters</li><li>Inject two cases — &quot;aptitude private&quot; vs. &quot;aptitude public&quot;</li><li>Count intra-clan conflict rate and genius success rate</li><li>Output &quot;Supreme-Bone Incident Institutional-Attribution Report&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-high</strong>. The Supreme-Bone dig-out and re-cultivation causal chain is clear early</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong>. The Supreme Bone&#39;s specific abilities late adjust multiple times with combat-power inflation</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: extreme-leaning-medium / single-log tendency</strong></li></ul><p>Add one layer: the Supreme-Bone dig-out&#39;s institutional meaning goes deeper than one family tragedy. It shows that in this world, the highest-tier aptitude is defaulted as distributable private property, not a public qualification everyone can strive for. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s anti-monopoly constitutionalization and Everyone-Has-a-Road Guarantee System precisely want to root out from the legal source the possibility of digging out aptitude — not punishing the bone-digger after the fact, but making bone-digging have no legal basis from the start.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: one aptitude torn into two wastes</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the Supreme-Bone incident is the original-sin scene of bloodline monopoly</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo breaks aristocratic-family monopoly; what Shi Hao encounters is intra-family marrow predation, deeper lesion</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: cannot even protect intra-clan weak, let alone Myriad Ranks</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: original-sin-level institutions cannot replicate to the multiverse</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-analysis-law-interpretation-of-the-original-sin-incident" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Analysis: Law Interpretation of the Original-Sin Incident <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-analysis-law-interpretation-of-the-original-sin-incident" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Analysis: Law Interpretation of the Original-Sin Incident&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Supreme-Bone dig-out incident is the predatory system&#39;s original-sin exhibit; its tragedy is repeatedly replayed in Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Alaya Network records as a negative textbook. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization extracts from this event the anti-predation axiom: a cultivator&#39;s Origin talent may not be seized, may not be transplanted, may not be traded. The law-first axiom ensures &quot;talent belongs to the person&quot; is written into the charter. The universal equal infinite law means Supreme-Bone-tier talent should have been attainable by everyone through cultivation, not only by digging out others&#39; — Lin Hao&#39;s Path D artificial Dao-rule rings are precisely the institutional response to this original sin.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Supreme-Bone dig-out is Perfect World&#39;s first blunt blow to readers, and Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s first diagnosis of this system: when aptitude can be dug out, this civilization from the first word stands on predation&#39;s side.</p><p>In the final analysis, Perfect World · Supreme-Bone dig-out incident described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./327_模块2-完美世界-以身为种的资源消耗.html">Entry 327 · Self-Seed</a> · <a href="./349_模块2-完美世界-天才的孤道宿命与悲情.html">Entry 349 · Youth Supreme Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/47-反垄断法.html">47-Anti-Monopoly Law</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const m=t(o,[["render",s]]);export{p as __pageData,m as default};
